 MAX_EVENTS 10000 * events with 256 actions each * ~80 bytes =3D huge (1000=
0<em>256</em>80 =3D 204MB). Too much for static. Let me use dynamic allocat=
ion (pointers) for objects/events/groups/layers, or smaller caps. The spec =
says support up to 10,000 objects and 10,000 events. But for our implementa=
tion we can allocate dynamically. Let me use dynamic arrays (Obj* objects w=
ith capacity). I'll implement a growable array.</p>
