<p>The parser needs to:</p>
<ol>
<li>Read file into memory (with size limit 16 MiB).</li>
<li>Check for embedded NUL (PBT_E_NUL).</li>
<li>Validate UTF-8 (PBT_E_UTF8) for required text contexts (we validate the=
 whole buffer's UTF-8? doc says invalid UTF-8 in required text context is e=
rror. I'll validate the whole file is valid UTF-8 OR at least quoted string=
