imit separately. A single token can't exceed token limit; but a line could =
be long with many tokens. I'll implement: read line (bounded by LINE_HARD_L=
IMIT; if a line's length &gt; limit =E2=86=92 PBT_E_LINE_TOO_LONG). Then to=
