<p><code class=3D"cr-inline-code">memset(&amp;cur_event,0,...)</code> sets =
<code class=3D"cr-inline-code">actions[1].type</code> =3D 0 =3D <code class=
=3D"cr-inline-code">ACT_ADD_SCORE</code> (not ACT_COUNT). So my gap detecti=
