<p>But wait =E2=80=94 the Event struct is also used elsewhere (e.g., in gam=
eplay). Initializing to ACT_COUNT as "empty" is semantically correct (ACT_C=
OUNT =3D no action). But other code that creates events (e.g., the writer, =
