UNT, that's fine for parsed scenes. For programmatically created events, th=
ey set types explicitly. OK.</p>
<p>But also the post-parse validation loop runs on <code class=3D"cr-inline=
-code">out-&gt;events[e]</code> which is the committed copy. Since I init c=
ur_event.actions to ACT_COUNT before parsing, and copy via struct assignmen=
t, the committed copy also has unset slots as ACT_COUNT.</p>
