 PBT_E_LAYER</code>. Fine. So s2 obj layer=3D"gameplay". Same.</p>
<p>I'm clearly missing something. Let me directly compare the byte-level: d=
ump t1 and t2 to files and diff them. The rtcheck already writes rtcheck.di=
ff.txt when mismatch. But that's only when text differs. Here text is equal=
