ocked: s1 locked=3D0, s2 locked=3D0. Fine.</p>
<p>Hmm, what about <code class=3D"cr-inline-code">o-&gt;order</code>? Not h=
ashed.</p>
<p>Let me look at the FULL object hash sequence again, especially the SPAWN=
 case and whether ball_radius is hashed even when has_ball_radius=3D0. For =
s1: has_ball_radius=3D0, ball_radius=3D0 =E2=86=92 fp hashes 0 and 0.0. For=
