<p>Wait, actually =E2=80=94 could the difference be in <code class=3D"cr-in=
line-code">o-&gt;u.cap.allowed_direction</code> for ONE_WAY_GATE? The finge=
rprint capsule case (142) does NOT hash allowed_direction. So no.</p>
<p>I'm going to just brute-force: compute the fingerprint contribution per =
object by hashing each object in isolation for s1 and s2 and find the diver=
