ULTIPLIER_OVERRIDE, writer emits <code class=3D"cr-inline-code">duration=3D=
%.6g</code> if ac-&gt;duration !=3D 0. So if duration=3D0, not emitted, re-=
parse duration=3D0. Equal.</p>
