ass=3D"cr-inline-code">st</code> then call sim_step. And sim_step increment=
s step to st+1. So the event recorded at step <code class=3D"cr-inline-code=
">st</code> should be applied at step <code class=3D"cr-inline-code">st</co=
de>. Consistent.</p>
<p>But there's a subtlety: sim_input is called once per step in simcheck (w=
ith current level state). Inside sim_input, I track edges. Good.</p>
