nsition should map to RPL_NUDGE_UP, and nudge "down" transition to RPL_NUDG=
E_LEFT/RIGHT/UP respectively. Since nudge is a momentary button, pressing l=
eft =3D RPL_NUDGE_LEFT (down), releasing =3D RPL_NUDGE_UP (up). Similarly r=
ight press=3DRPL_NUDGE_RIGHT(down), release=3DRPL_NUDGE_UP(up). So the "up"=
 array for k=3D3 (nl) and k=3D4 (nr) should be RPL_NUDGE_UP, and k=3D5 (nu)=
 also RPL_NUDGE_UP. And down[k] for k=3D3,4,5 =3D RPL_NUDGE_LEFT, RPL_NUDGE=
_RIGHT, RPL_NUDGE_UP. That's fine.</p>
