<p>Given the scope, let me design:</p>
<p><strong>json.c</strong> =E2=80=94 a minimal recursive-descent JSON parse=
r producing a value tree:</p>
<ul>
<li>value types: NULL, BOOL, INT (long long), DOUBLE, STRING, ARRAY, OBJECT=
.</li>
<li>Functions: <code class=3D"cr-inline-code">JsonValue* json_parse(const c=
