a lighter consistency: ensure RELEASE_RESULT.tests matches the unified run =
counts, version consistency, and that RELEASE_EVIDENCE references exist (fi=
les/visual IDs present).</li>
<li>referenced evidence existence: for artifacts (file paths), check file e=
