nce exists, that's enough).</li>
<li>version consistency: task_package_version and build_id consistent betwe=
en the two files.</li>
<li>Returns 0 if all pass.</li>
</ul>
<p>This is a lot of C. Let me write it carefully but compactly. I'll put js=
