le with build_tools.sh (new script) or extend build_core.sh.</p>
<p>Let me create a build_tools.sh that compiles locscan and releasecheck (l=
inking json.o, yaml.o, and for releasecheck maybe json.o only).</p>
<p>Given the time, I'll write these files. Let me be efficient. I'll write =
json.c first.</p>
